25","r":"8"}}},"notes":{"w0d2":"4.55mile 56min felt amazing but zone 5 the whole time","w1d0":"Great","w1d1":"Sore back from yesterday I think, energy was great and felt strong","w1d2":"5miles 1hr 5min \nIt was hard, low energy and headache. ","w2d0":"Extremely sore back","w2d1":"Great","w3d0":"Great after the long weekend in Chicago ","w3d1":"Great ","w3d2":"5.24 1:10 it was hard I felt gut issues. I walked all the uphills to keep the easy effort \nAvg pace 13:29\nZone 5 most of the time","w3d4":"Low energy not very motivated happy it was deload","w4d0":"Good but short in time","w4d1":"Great","w4d2":"4.76miles 630ft elevation 1hr\nFelt great but did power hike uphills","w5d0":"Great strong lots of energy no inflammation or soreness ","w5d2":"3.2mi 12:46average pace 40:00min felt great ","w5d4":"Average energy good, strength felt flat I couldn't push more","w6d0":"Good energy, cleans feel heavy on my back, same with rdl but I was able to push weights","w6d1":"Amazing ","w6d2":"5mile 1:06min 13mile average pace, no gi issues but equally hard as last dimple dell race","w6d4":"Great and strong","w6d5":"3.1miles 883ft elevation gain 53:00\nApple pouch half way felt amazing ","w7d0":"Strong ","w7d1":"Energy great, I feel like I got in the zone and was enjoying the struggle like I felt pumped. Starting get that stamina back. Big win","w7d2":"5.6miles 1000ft elevation 1:17min \nEnergy was great, no gi issues, able to trek a consistent pace, no crash","w7d4":"Felt energized, strong, stamina up, able to pr some reps","w7d5":"Rest day","w8d4":"Energy great, lower back sore, glutes sore, felt strong ","w8d3":"Lower back extremely painful and sore, skipped clean pulls. Glutes feel flat no muscle activation ","w8d5":"3.6mi 965ft elevation gain 57min\n1 apple pouch\nFelt great, power hike uphills","w9d1":"Really energetic, and strong, things felt light, stamina up","w9d2":"Easy run 3mi 40min 12:33avg \nFelt fresh didn't do solitude","w9d4":"Felt well rested and strong","w9d5":"3.6mile 1163ft elevation 1h10m\n3 dates 1 apple pouch\nGreat energy no gi issues, able to power hike ","w10d0":"I felt like I was moving good in the grove no pain no tightness but also I didn’t feel like I wanted to push for more volume it felt like a good rpe ","w10d2":"Felt really good, I was able to run easily the whole thing","w10d4":"Felt great","w11d0":"Feeling great, looking back 90% of my training days have felt amazing. Today was sweat session without pushing weights.","w11d1":"Nice and smooth, felt like I wanted more but didn’t things felt light and easy","w11d2":"Did a 4.3mi 59min 600ft elevation with 6 pickups legs felt amazing and heart felt good in the uphills ","w11d6":"DNF 4.5mile 2hrs10min 2800f elevation did not make it to the cutoff of 2hrs at the top of the peak, elevation got me quickly.","w12d0":"I substituted walking lunges with step ups knee drive, good energy, still a little sore from the weekend ","w12d1":"Did something to my shoulder blade on the last set of shoulder press. Feels like out of place like it needs to be cracked but I can’t get it","w12d2":"First day of period\nFelt fatigued but pushed through \n4.8mile 1:09 800ft elevation ","w12d4":"My back/shoulder are back in place after the race! I think the impact put whatever was out of place back in. \nToday everything felt great, energy is starting to go up again and I’m liking my body comp I feel good","w12d5":"Alta run 1hr not sure the elevation \nLegs felt a little heavy","w13d0":"Step ups instead of lunges\nEnergy was top\nFeeling great and strong\nWoke up heavy at 153lb","w13d1":"Push press hurts my shoulder, I’ve had a bad shoulder since the beginning of this program and shoulder press with barbell is one of the few I can’t do. Let’s change this in the program.\nToday felt strong, lots of energy\nSleep: 10:30-4:00am and 4:30-5am","w13d3":"A little tight but good overall \nNice sweaty session ","w13d5":"Alta 1:10 1135ft elevation 4.4miles","w14d0":"Weight 151\nFelt strong energetic ","w14d1":"Felt so good and strong! Feeling benefited from this program ","w14d2":"5.77mile 1hr 22min 1435ft elevation gain, felt strong but had stomach cramp all the way down which caused inability to go faster","w14d4":"Good energy, weight at 151 felt strong able to push some lifts","w14d5":"4mile 988ft elevation 1hr. Felt amazing ","w15d0":"Great!!!!!","w15d2":"4.4miles 900ft elevation gain 59:44\n","w15d4":"Felt good, good energy and sleep 150lb body weight and starting to really notice body comp","w15d5":"5miles 1,145 elevation 1hr 10min\nFelt really good and easy, I wish I could find this sustained pace when racing ","w16d0":"Felt great lots of energy ","w16d1":"Energy is still good, weight going up 152lb I’m going to start my period any time ","w16d3":"Did easy upper ","w16d5":"Finish in 2hr 25min!!\nFelt amazing the whole time, successful program ","w17d1":"Great but still very some from the race, might rest tomorrow instead of race","w17d2":"4.94miles 1:07:00 823ft elevation gain\nFelt so easy good compared to the last snowbird race\nNo gi issues energy great no cramps","w17d4":"Great","w17d5":"Ran out of time good workout though ","w18d0":"Amazing strong but I’m not able to do the finisher within the hour I still feel like I got a great workout ","w18d1":"Great but again not time for finisher, I felt strong. Lots of sweat in this program. My weight is up to 153-154lb\nI’m a bit sore I feel it at night when I’m sleeping or waking up","w18d2":"1hr 1 min","w18d3":"This was good I was able to complete on time, woke up extremely tired ","w18d5":"My shoulder is a little buggy, felt it on the thrusters like hot inside, energy was great ","w19d0":"I need to update landmine to single leg dumbbell \nDidn’t finish last superset","w19d1":"Great workout sleep well, high energy, felt strong","w19d2":"3.4mile 43min 560ft elevation gain","w19d4":"Great flowy session, good energy and every body part felt good strong energetic ","w20d1":"Weighted deadbug"},"prs":{"Bulgaria